  "question": "What is the capstone project?",
  "contextNamespace": "2026-technest",
  "answer": "The capstone project is a multi-user AI product that you and your team will develop over four weeks (weeks 9-12). The goal is to take the full-stack Next.js + Neon + Vercel codebase you built individually in weeks 1-8 and evolve it into a deployed product that serves a real audience beyond your classmates. The project should include features such as sign-up, onboarding, data isolation per user, and a reason for a stranger to come back tomorrow.\n\n— Reference: TECHNEST Capstone Project (versioned_docs\\version-2026-technest\\capstone\\capstone-spec.mdx)\n— Reference: TECHNEST AI Track — Curriculum Outline (versioned_docs\\version-2026-technest\\curriculum-outline.mdx)",
